+<h1>Identity &amp; Tenancy — ADR-001 Contract Package</h1>
+<p><strong>Status:</strong> Proposed contract fixtures; not production enforcement evidence.</p>
+<p>This package turns the owner-approved ADR-001 decisions into machine-readable contracts and a negative isolation matrix. It does not implement an identity provider, PostgreSQL RLS, KMS, object storage, queues, webhooks, backups, or a hosted control plane.</p>
+<h2>Governing decisions</h2>
